24
00:01:54,750 --> 00:01:59,270
Mrs. Fairfax was summoned to give information respecting the resources of

25
00:01:59,271 --> 00:02:03,889
the house in shores, dresses, draperies of any kind.

26
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:10,849
And certain wardrobes of the third story were ransacked, and their contents in the

