Afterwards, he named the two Mrs. Eshton and Mrs. Dent.

35
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,680
He looked at me.

36
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:56,172
I happened to be near him as I had been fastening the clasp of Mrs.

37
00:02:56,173 --> 00:02:58,150
Dent's bracelet, which had got loose.

38
00:02:59,555 --> 00:03:00,555
Will you play?

39
00:03:01,130 --> 00:03:02,130
He asked.

40
00:03:02,369 --> 00:03:03,369
I shook my head.

41
00:03:04,060 --> 00:03:07,430
He did not insist, which I rather feared he would have done.

42
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:11,229
He allowed me to return quietly to my usual seat.

43
00:03:13,619 --> 00:03:16,369
He and his aides now withdrew behind the curtain.

44
00:03:17,090 --> 00:03:19,354
The other party, which was headed by Colonel

