48
00:03:33,950 --> 00:03:35,430
No, I heard her say.

49
00:03:36,229 --> 00:03:38,610
She looks too stupid for any game of the sort.

50
00:03:40,369 --> 00:03:43,150
A long bell tinkled and the curtain drew up.

51
00:03:44,290 --> 00:03:49,349
Within the arch, the bulky figure of Sir George Lynn, who Mr. Rochester had

