53
00:03:53,610 --> 00:03:57,389
Before him, on a table lay open a large book.

54
00:03:58,419 --> 00:04:02,176
And at his side stood Amy Eshton, draped in

55
00:04:02,177 --> 00:04:05,330
Mr. Rochester's cloak and holding a book in her hand.

56
00:04:06,459 --> 00:04:13,189
Somebody unseen rang the bell merrily, then Adele, who had insisted on being one

