70
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:25,729
The drawing-room, as I have before observed,

71
00:05:25,730 --> 00:05:29,111
was raised two steps above the dining -room.

72
00:05:29,465 --> 00:05:33,689
And on the top of the upper step, placed a yard or two back within the room,

73
00:05:34,270 --> 00:05:38,990
appeared a large marble basin, which I recognised as an ornament of the

74
00:05:38,991 --> 00:05:46,230
conservatory, where it usually stood, surrounded by exotics and tenented by goldfish.

75
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,467
And once it must have been transported with

76
00:05:49,468 --> 00:05:52,670
