77
00:05:54,220 --> 00:05:58,768
Seated on the carpet by the side of this basin was seen

78
00:05:58,769 --> 00:06:03,509
Mr. Rochester, costume in shawls with a turban on his head.

79
00:06:04,330 --> 00:06:10,169
His dark eyes and swarthy skin and pain in features suited the costume exactly.

80
00:06:10,849 --> 00:06:16,850
He looked the very model of an eastern emir, an agent or a victim of the bowstring.

81
00:06:17,830 --> 00:06:20,909
Presently advanced interview, Miss Ingram.

82
00:06:21,970 --> 00:06:24,790
She too was a tired in oriental fashion.

83
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:28,470
A crimson scarf tied sash-like around the waist.

84
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:31,970
An embroidered hankerchief knotted about her temples.

85
00:06:32,849 --> 00:06:37,450
Her beautifully moulded arms bare, one of them upraised in the act of

86
00:06:37,451 --> 00:06:41,229
supporting a picture, poised gracefully on her head.

87
00:06:42,189 --> 00:06:47,270
Both her cast of form and feature, her complexion and her general air,

88
00:06:48,029 --> 00:06:53,209
