And such was doubtless the character she intended to represent.

90
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:03,189
She approached the basin and bent over it as if to fill her picture.

91
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:06,310
She again lifted it to her head.

92
00:07:07,619 --> 00:07:11,009
The personage on the well-brink now seemed to accost her.

93
00:07:11,509 --> 00:07:15,222
To make some request, she hasted, let down

94
00:07:15,223 --> 00:07:18,951
