98
00:07:31,849 --> 00:07:34,470
Kneeling, he laid the treasure at her feet.

99
00:07:35,369 --> 00:07:38,689
In credulity and delight were expressed by her looks and gestures.

100
00:07:39,939 --> 00:07:44,169
The stranger fussed the bracelets on her arms and the rings in her ears.

101
00:07:44,810 --> 00:07:46,549
It was a laser and Rebecca.

102
00:07:47,770 --> 00:07:49,389
The camels only were wanting.

103
00:07:50,599 --> 00:07:53,470
The divining party again laid their heads together.

104
00:07:54,470 --> 00:07:58,830
Apparently, they could not agree about the word or syllable the scene illustrated.

105
00:08:00,264 --> 00:08:04,849
Colonel Dent, their spokesman, demanded the tablo of the whole.

106
00:08:05,779 --> 00:08:07,869
Whereupon the curtain again descended.

107
00:08:09,005 --> 00:08:13,490
On its third rising, only a portion of the drawing-room was disclosed.

108
00:08:14,119 --> 00:08:20,131
The rest being concealed by a screen, hung with some sort of dark and coarse drapery.

109
