115
00:08:46,599 --> 00:08:52,970
I knew Mr. Rochester, though the begrimmed face, the disordered dress, his coat

116
00:08:52,971 --> 00:08:58,330
hanging loose from one arm, as if it had been almost torn from his back in a scuffle.

117
00:08:58,830 --> 00:09:02,674
The desperate and scowling countenance, the rough,

118
00:09:02,675 --> 00:09:05,951
bristling hair might well have disguised him.

119
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:11,990
As he moved, a chain clanked to his wrists were attached fetters.

120
00:09:13,119 --> 00:09:17,849
Bride well, exclaimed Colonel Dent, and the charade was solved.

121
00:09:19,430 --> 00:09:22,264
A sufficient interval, having elapsed for the performers to

122
00:09:22,265 --> 00:09:26,110
resume their ordinary costume, they re-entered the dining-room.

123
00:09:35,610 --> 00:09:36,930
Mr. that of the three characters.

124
00:09:37,909 --> 00:09:39,729
I liked you in the last best.

125
00:09:40,369 --> 00:09:42,270
Oh, had you but lived a few years earlier?

126
00:09:42,990 --> 00:09:45,450
What a gallant gentleman highwayman you would have made.

127
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:52,029
Is all the suit washed from my face, he asked, turning it towards her?

128
00:09:52,569 --> 00:09:54,669
Alas, yes, the more's the pity.

129
00:09:55,430 --> 00:09:59,689
Nothing could be more becoming to your complexion than that ruffian's rouge.

130
00:10:01,119 --> 00:10:03,150
You would like a hero of the road then.

131
00:10:04,259 --> 00:10:08,509
An English hero of the road would be the next best thing to an Italian bandit,

132
00:10:09,139 --> 00:10:12,369
and that could only be surpassed by eleven teen pirate.

133
00:10:13,689 --> 00:10:17,849
Well, whatever I am, remember you are my wife.

134
00:10:18,450 --> 00:10:22,470
We were married an hour since, in the presence of all these witnesses.

135
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:26,049
She giggled, and her colour rose.

136
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:29,189
Now Dent continued Mr. Rochester.

137
00:10:30,009 --> 00:10:31,169
It is your turn.

138
00:10:32,380 --> 00:10:37,450
And as the other party withdrew, he and his band took the vacated seats.

139
00:10:39,064 --> 00:10:43,150
Missing room placed herself at her leader's right hand, the other diviners

140
00:10:43,151 --> 00:10:45,909
