I no longer remember, but I still see the consultation which followed each scene.

150
00:11:19,689 --> 00:11:24,090
I see Mr. Rochester turn to Missingroom, and Missingroom to him.

151
00:11:24,939 --> 00:11:28,870
I see her incline her head towards him till the jetty

152
