156
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:53,409
I have told you, reader, that I had learnt to love Mr. Rochester.

157
00:11:53,411 --> 00:12:00,430
I could not unlove him now merely because I found that he had ceased to notice me,

158
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:06,729
because I might pass hours in his presence and he would never once turn his eyes in

159
00:12:06,730 --> 00:12:12,970
my direction, because I saw all his attentions appropriated by a great lady,

160
00:12:13,669 --> 00:12:19,830
who scorned to touch me with the hem of her robes as she passed, who, if ever her

161
