163
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:35,150
I could not unlove him because I felt sure he would soon marry this very lady,

164
00:12:36,159 --> 00:12:41,009
because I read daily in her a proud security in his intentions respecting her,

165
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:47,389
because I witnessed hourly in him a style of courtship, which, if careless and

