had conceived against little Adele, pushing her away with some contomelius

185
00:14:31,034 --> 00:14:37,310
epithet if she happened to approach her, sometimes ordering her from the room and

186
00:14:37,311 --> 00:14:40,189
always treating her with coldness and acrimony.

187
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:44,551
Other eyes, besides mine, watched these manifestations

188
00:14:44,552 --> 00:14:49,709
of character, watched them closely, keenly, shrewdly.

189
00:14:50,630 --> 00:14:56,810
Yes, the future bridegroom, Mr. Rochester himself, exercised over his intended a

190
00:14:56,811 --> 00:15:02,450
ceaseless surveillance, and it was from this sagacity, this guardedness of his,

191
00:15:03,319 --> 00:15:09,110
this perfect clear consciousness of his fair ones defects, this obvious absence of

192
00:15:09,111 --> 00:15:14,529
passion in his sentiments towards her, that my ever torturing pain arose.

193
00:15:16,330 --> 00:15:21,250
I saw he was going to marry her, for family, perhaps political reasons,

194
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:24,409
because her rank in connections suited him.

195
00:15:25,310 --> 00:15:28,793
I felt he had not given her his love, and that her

196
