199
00:15:45,869 --> 00:15:51,549
If she had managed the victory at once, and he had yielded and sincerely laid his

200
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:56,950
heart at her feet, I should have covered my face, turned to the wall, and

201
00:15:57,099 --> 00:15:59,490
