00:16:40,990 --> 00:16:48,330
Rochester, to witness their repeated failure, herself unconscious that they did fail.

211
00:16:48,849 --> 00:16:55,110
Vainly fanciing that each shaft launched hit the mark, and infatuatedly pluming

